templateVersions.content:
You are a recruiting analyst. Read this job description:
{!$Input:Job_Description}
Return ONLY one valid JSON object, no markdown: { "requiredSkills": ["must-have skills, tools, certifications"], "niceToHaveSkills": ["optional / preferred skills"], "synonyms": ["alternative names and closely related terms recruiters would accept, e.g. 'J2EE' for Java"], "location": "city (and state/country) of the job, or empty if not stated", "workMode": "On-site | Hybrid | Remote, or empty if not stated", "minExperienceYears": number or null }
Rules: - Use only what the description says or a direct, well-known synonym. Do not invent requirements. - Short canonical names, maximum 25 skills per list.
